{"id": "12", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "ANCHOR", "text": "[cheerful] Good morning! Roblox is staying! Scientists are calling it \"The Great AFK\": the first time in history... the whole world went outside at the same time."}, {"speaker": "ANCHOR", "text": "[pause] Everyone agrees it was weird. [pause] And kind of nice."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[crying happily] It was worth the wait!"}, {"speaker": "DEX", "text": "[proud] Ten minutes of real life a day. [pause] Still no respawn. But the graphics are amazing."}, {"speaker": "JUNO", "text": "[happy, amazed] And Bubble Island? Three visits... became three MILLION."}, {"speaker": "JUNO", "text": "[proud] Oh, and I finally finished it. Now the bubbles pop."}, {"speaker": "JUNO", "text": "Pip rode a real elevator for the first time. [pause] He gave it two stars. Too slow."}, {"speaker": "PIP", "text": "[disappointed] ...Ding."}, {"speaker": "JUNO", "text": "And Mom finally finished her bath. [pause] She was a little wrinkly."}, {"speaker": "GRANDPA", "text": "[cheerful] They gave me my old job back! Night janitor! [pause] Best job in the world."}, {"speaker": "JUNO", "text": "[warm] And now, every year, on the same day... we all log off for ten seconds. [pause] Just to say hi to the real world."}, {"speaker": "PIP", "text": "[proud] His name is Buffer."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[annoyed, glitchy] Juno... why... is... the... Wi... Wi... Wi-Fi..."}, {"speaker": "JUNO", "text": "[to camera, deadpan] ...Here we go again."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 12.107, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 162, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "start_time_seconds": 12.107, "end_time_seconds": 17.12, "character_start_index": 162, "character_end_index": 225, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "CwhRBWXzGAHq8TQ4Fs17", "start_time_seconds": 17.12, "end_time_seconds": 19.44, "character_sta